# Release archives carry the application, not the release harness. git archive
# honors export-ignore, so the tarball published as a release asset omits CI
# config and dev-only tooling.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded: Makefile, bin, lib, frontend, docs, AGENTS.md and
# test/. `make install-user` copies bin lib frontend README.md AGENTS.md docs,
# so dropping any of those makes the documented install fail from the tarball.
.github/                 export-ignore
.forgejo/                export-ignore
.ruby-lsp/               export-ignore
.pre-commit-config.yaml  export-ignore
.versionrc.js            export-ignore
